<title>GERMANY: German June 6-mo private sector lending up 7.2 pct.</title>
<headline>German June 6-mo private sector lending up 7.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bundesbank gave the following six-month annualised growth rates for June in a table accompanying its June money supply data release</p>
<p>    AGGREGATE			   JUNE	MAY</p>
<p>    Lending to private sector     +7.2	+8.7</p>
<p>    Monetary capital formation    +4.3	+4.0</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
